The '''Wraith''' is a mob that spawns during [[Spooky Festival]]s at night. 

== Spawning ==
'''Wraiths''' can spawn in the {{Zone|Graveyard}}, {{Zone|Wilderness}}, {{Zone|Spider's Den}} and {{Zone|Obsidian Sanctuary}} at night during a [[Spooky Festival]]. There is a {{Green|5.1%}} chance of a Wraith spawning from a [[Trick or Treat Chest]].

== Behavior ==
'''Wraiths''' have {{Stat|HP|15}} and deal {{Stat|dmg|50}}. They fly around the player, so they can be very hard to hit. Every attack against them deals {{HP|1}} of damage. The [[Ghoul Buster]] deals {{HP|2}} of damage instead.

