== Trivia ==
*The {{Ench|Thunderlord}} and {{Ench|Thunderbolt}} were previously bugged, and dealt {{DamageType|true}} to the mob, ignoring their {{stat|defense}}. This was patched in a later update.
*The Wraith may be a reference to the [[terraria:Wraith|Wraith]] in ''Terraria'' with similar sounds and texture.
*The wraith is technically a player-model mob. Therefore, it has a body, albeit an invisible one. Because of this, one ''can'' aim a hit below its head and deal damage without actually punching the wraith's head itself. 

